#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:4
msgid "Scanning Paper Drawings"
msgstr "扫描纸张图纸"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:6
msgid ""
"Currently OpenToonz DOES NOT SUPPORT the native scanning functionality, as "
"described in this page. Instead you can use the provided GTS scanning and "
"cleaning software, please follow `this link to download GTS <https://"
"opentoonz.github.io/e/download/gts.html>`_ ."
msgstr ""
"目前OpenToonz不支持本机扫描功能，如本页所述。相反，您可以使用提供的GTS扫描和清"
"洁软件，请点击“此链接下载GTS”<https://opentoonz.github.io/e/download/gts."
"html>`_ ."

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:8
msgid ""
"This manual page is preserved in its original form, in case the scanning code "
"of OpenToonz is reactivated in a future version."
msgstr "本手册页以原始形式保留，以防OpenToonz的扫描码在未来版本中重新激活。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:11
msgid ""
"In order to be managed by OpenToonz, paper drawings have to be scanned into "
"OpenToonz. Paper drawings can be both animation levels, consisting of a large "
"number of sequenced drawings, and other elements such as backgrounds and "
"overlays."
msgstr ""
"In order to be managed by OpenToonz, paper drawings have to be scanned into "
"OpenToonz. Paper drawings can be both animation levels, consisting of a large "
"number of sequenced drawings, and other elements such as backgrounds and "
"overlays."

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:13
msgid ""
"The scan process can be done in different modes, and in case autocenter is "
"needed it has to follow specific guidelines."
msgstr ""
"扫描过程可以在不同的模式下进行，如果需要自动中心，则必须遵循特定的指导方针。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:15
msgid ""
"Animation levels have to be defined first and then scanned according to a "
"defined set of parameters."
msgstr "必须首先定义动画级别，然后根据一组定义的参数进行扫描。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:21
msgid "Supported Scanners"
msgstr "支持的扫描仪"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:22
msgid ""
"OpenToonz supports directly, by using internal drivers, some specific "
"scanners via a USB connection; all the other scanners are supported via any "
"type of connection by using TWAIN drivers."
msgstr ""
"OpenToonz通过USB连接使用内部驱动程序直接支持某些特定的扫描仪；使用TWAIN驱动程"
"序通过任何类型的连接支持所有其他扫描仪。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:24
msgid "|define_scanner|"
msgstr "|定义扫描仪|"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:26
msgid ""
"For an updated list of directly supported scanners, please visit the "
"`OpenToonz Web site <https://opentoonz.github.io/e/>`_ ."
msgstr ""
"有关直接支持的扫描仪的更新列表，请访问“OpenToonz网站”<https://opentoonz."
"github.io/e/>`_ ."

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:28
msgid ""
"If your scanner is supported via internal drivers, the scanning process is "
"managed completely by OpenToonz and the Scan Settings dialog; if it is not, "
"the scanning process is managed by the TWAIN interface."
msgstr ""
"如果您的扫描仪通过内部驱动程序支持，则扫描过程完全由OpenToonz和“扫描设置”对话"
"框管理；如果不是，则扫描过程由TWAIN接口管理。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:30
msgid ""
"On Windows, the TWAIN drivers provided with the scanner need to be installed. "
"Note that if you decide to use internal drivers, you have to disable the "
"**Windows Image Acquisition (WIA)** service on your computer; if you want to "
"use TWAIN drivers, you have to enable it."
msgstr ""
"在Windows上，需要安装扫描仪附带的TWAIN驱动程序。请注意，如果您决定使用内部驱动"
"程序，则必须禁用计算机上的**Windows图像采集（WIA）**服务；如果你想使用TWAIN驱"
"动程序，你必须启用它。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:32
msgid ""
"On macOS, you need to install the TWAIN drivers only if you are going to use "
"them. Note that if you decide to use internal drivers, any TWAIN driver "
"referring to that scanner has to be removed."
msgstr ""
"在macOS上，只有当您要使用TWAIN驱动程序时，才需要安装它们。请注意，如果您决定使"
"用内部驱动程序，则必须删除任何引用该扫描仪的TWAIN驱动程序。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:34
msgid ""
"The driver you want to use must be selected according to your scanner before "
"starting the scanning process. You can choose whether to use the internal or "
"TWAIN drivers; in the latter case, you have to select which driver to use "
"from a list based on the TWAIN drivers installed on your computer."
msgstr ""
"在开始扫描过程之前，必须根据扫描仪选择要使用的驱动程序。您可以选择是使用内部驱"
"动程序还是TWAIN驱动程序；在后一种情况下，您必须根据计算机上安装的TWAIN驱动程序"
"从列表中选择要使用的驱动程序。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:36
msgid ""
"When using TWAIN drivers you need to specify the driver every time you "
"restart OpenToonz: the dialog box is automatically displayed when you select "
"any Scan related command."
msgstr ""
"使用TWAIN驱动程序时，每次重新启动OpenToonz时都需要指定驱动程序：当您选择任何与"
"扫描相关的命令时，会自动显示对话框。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:38
msgid "**To install TWAIN drivers:**"
msgstr "**要安装TWAIN驱动程序，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:40
#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:58
msgid "Refer to the scanner documentation for more details."
msgstr "有关更多详细信息，请参阅扫描仪文档。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:42
msgid ""
"**Windows only - To disable or enable the Windows Image Acquisition (WIA) "
"service:**"
msgstr ""
"**仅限Windows-要禁用或启用Windows图像采集（WIA）服务，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:44
msgid "Open the Control Panel  →  Administrative Tools  →  **Services** dialog."
msgstr "打开控制面板→  管理工具→  **服务**对话框。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:46
msgid ""
"Right-click the **Windows Image Acquisition (WIA)** service and choose "
"**Properties** from the menu that opens."
msgstr ""
"右键单击**Windows图像采集（WIA）**服务，然后从打开的菜单中选择**属性**。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:48
msgid "In the Properties dialog do one of the following:"
msgstr "在“属性”对话框中，执行以下操作之一："

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:50
msgid "Set the **Startup Type** option to **Disabled** to use internal drivers."
msgstr "将**启动类型**选项设置为**禁用**以使用内部驱动程序。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:52
msgid "Set the **Startup Type** option to **Automatic** to use TWAIN drivers."
msgstr "将**启动类型**选项设置为**自动**以使用TWAIN驱动程序。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:54
msgid "Restart the computer."
msgstr "重启计算机。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:56
msgid "**Macintosh only - To remove the scanner TWAIN drivers:**"
msgstr "**仅限Macintosh-要删除扫描仪TWAIN驱动程序，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:60
msgid "**To define the scanner:**"
msgstr "**要定义扫描仪，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:62
msgid "Choose Scan & Cleanup  →  **Define Scanner...**."
msgstr "选择扫描和清理→  **定义扫描仪。..**."

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:64
#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:145
#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:157
#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:204
msgid "Do one of the following:"
msgstr "执行以下操作之一："

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:66
msgid ""
"If your scanner is directly supported, choose Scanner Driver  →  "
"**Internal**, and click the **OK** button."
msgstr ""
"如果您的扫描仪直接受支持，请选择扫描仪驱动程序→  **内部**，然后单击**确定**按"
"钮。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:68
msgid ""
"If your scanner is not directly supported, be sure that TWAIN drivers are "
"installed, and choose Scanner Driver  →  **TWAIN**, and click the **OK** "
"button: in the dialog that opens, select the TWAIN driver related to your "
"scanner."
msgstr ""
"如果您的扫描仪不受直接支持，请确保已安装TWAIN驱动程序，并选择“扫描仪驱动程"
"序”→  **TWAIN**，然后单击**确定**按钮：在打开的对话框中，选择与扫描仪相关的"
"TWAIN驱动程序。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:74
msgid "Scanning Modes"
msgstr "扫描模式"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:75
msgid ""
"Drawings can be scanned mainly in three different modes: *black and white*, "
"*greyscale* and *color*."
msgstr "图纸的扫描主要有三种模式：*黑白*、*灰度*和*彩色*。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:77
msgid ""
"The first two modes can be used to acquire standard lineart drawings whose "
"outline is usually made in a single color, that during the scanning is "
"acquired as black or dark grey. Even if the outline color is lost during the "
"scanning, later on you can assign one or more colors to it during the "
"painting process."
msgstr ""
"前两种模式可用于获取标准线条图，其轮廓通常以单一颜色绘制，在扫描过程中被获取为"
"黑色或深灰色。即使轮廓颜色在扫描过程中丢失，稍后您也可以在绘制过程中为其指定一"
"种或多种颜色。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:79
msgid ""
"**Black and white** scanning gives you the most immediate results, and fewer "
"parameters need to be set. Once a **Threshold:** value is set, pixels of the "
"scanned image are considered as either black or white. Due to the simplicity "
"of this concept, less time is required to scan the image, and scanned files "
"are lighter to manage. Even if images show hard edges, the proper "
"antialiasing will be added during the cleanup process."
msgstr ""
"**黑白**扫描可获得最直接的结果，需要设置的参数更少。一旦设置了**阈值：**值，扫"
"描图像的像素将被视为黑色或白色。由于这个概念的简单性，扫描图像所需的时间更少，"
"扫描的文件也更易于管理。即使图像显示硬边缘，在清理过程中也会添加适当的抗锯齿处"
"理。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:81
msgid ""
"**Greyscale** scanning, being based on a range of grey values, requires a "
"longer scanning time. Determining **Brightness:** and **Contrast:** "
"parameters depends considerably on the individual animated sequence and on "
"what you want to achieve. The greyscale mode also offers **Autoadjust** "
"options during the cleanup process, useful to even the differences between "
"drawings made by key animators and those made by in-betweeners. See  :ref:"
"`Autoadjusting Greyscale Lineart Drawings "
"<autoadjusting_greyscale_lineart_drawings>`  ."
msgstr ""
"**灰度**扫描基于一系列灰度值，需要更长的扫描时间。确定**亮度：**和**对比度：**"
"参数在很大程度上取决于单个动画序列和您想要实现的目标。灰度模式在清理过程中还提"
"供了**自动调整**选项，甚至可以区分关键动画师和中间人绘制的图形之间的差异。请参"
"阅：ref:“自动调整灰度线性图形<Autoadjusting_Greyscale_linear_Drawings>”。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:83
msgid ""
"**Color** scanning is for scanning colored lineart and other colored images "
"as backgrounds and overlays. Using colors in lineart allows you to draw "
"different lines with different colors, for example a character outline in "
"black and its body shadow in red or in blue. As colored lines can be "
"identified later during the cleanup process, scanning colored artwork in "
"colors allows you to preserve different line colors with no need of intensive "
"painting work. See  :ref:`Processing Colored Lineart Drawings "
"<processing_colored_lineart_drawings>`  ."
msgstr ""
"**彩色**扫描用于扫描彩色线条和其他彩色图像作为背景和叠加。在线条艺术中使用颜色"
"可以让你用不同的颜色绘制不同的线条，例如，一个黑色的角色轮廓和一个红色或蓝色的"
"身体阴影。由于在清理过程中稍后可以识别彩色线条，因此以彩色扫描彩色艺术品可以让"
"您保留不同的线条颜色，而不需要密集的绘画工作。请参阅：ref:`处理彩色线性图纸"
"<Processing_colored_linert_Drawings>`。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:89
msgid "Scanning Guidelines for Autocentering"
msgstr "自动输入扫描指南"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:90
msgid ""
"To autocenter scanned drawings during the cleanup process, the pegbar holes "
"need to be detected on the images (see  :ref:`Autocentering "
"<autocentering>`  ). For this reason they have to be scanned in black, by "
"properly preparing the scanner and performing the scanning process according "
"to the following guidelines."
msgstr ""
"要在清理过程中自动输入扫描的图形，需要在图像上检测钉杆孔（请参见：ref:“自动输"
"入<自动输入>”）。因此，必须按照以下指南正确准备扫描仪并执行扫描过程，以黑色扫"
"描它们。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:96
msgid "Preparing Scanners"
msgstr "准备扫描仪"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:97
msgid ""
"If you use the scanner automatic paper feeder, you should stick a piece of "
"thin black tape in the feeder on the opposite side of the scanner lamp. Be "
"sure to stick the black tape in a position to face the peg holes when the "
"paper is fed into the scanner."
msgstr ""
"如果您使用扫描仪自动进纸器，您应该在扫描仪灯的另一侧的进纸器中粘贴一条薄的黑色"
"胶带。当纸张被送入扫描仪时，一定要将黑色胶带粘在面向钉孔的位置。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:99
msgid ""
"If you use the scanner bed, you should place a black sheet of paper under the "
"scanner cover, so that when a drawing is scanned facing down the glass of the "
"scanner bed, the black paper will be behind it. The black paper must be "
"larger than your animation paper, but it does not have to cover the entire "
"scanner bed."
msgstr ""
"如果您使用扫描仪床，您应该在扫描仪盖下放置一张黑色纸张，这样当扫描面向扫描仪床"
"玻璃的图形时，黑色纸张就会在后面。黑色纸张必须大于动画纸张，但不必覆盖整个扫描"
"仪床。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:105
msgid "Scanning Artwork"
msgstr "扫描艺术品"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:106
msgid ""
"It is better to use quite thick animation paper for your artwork: very thin "
"paper may jam the scanner, and the scanner light may pass through picking up "
"some grey from the black paper or tape placed behind it. When this happens, "
"the process will take longer to perform and will produce a poor quality "
"result."
msgstr ""
"最好使用相当厚的动画纸来制作你的艺术品：非常薄的纸可能会堵塞扫描仪，扫描仪的光"
"线可能会穿过，从放置在它后面的黑色纸或胶带上拾取一些灰色。当这种情况发生时，这"
"个过程将需要更长的时间来执行，并且会产生质量较差的结果。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:108
msgid ""
"Avoid using *black* or *colored* paper reinforcements around the pegbar holes "
"in your drawing sheets. The scanner has to read the exact shape of the hole "
"punches, and colored reinforcements may cause holes to be scanned larger than "
"their actual size. If you do use *white* reinforcements, make sure they are "
"aligned directly over the peg holes: if the holes are slightly covered by the "
"reinforcement, the registration may fail."
msgstr ""
"避免在图纸中的钉杆孔周围使用*黑色*或*彩色*纸张加固。扫描仪必须读取孔冲头的确切"
"形状，彩色钢筋可能会导致孔被扫描得比实际尺寸大。如果您确实使用了*白色*钢筋，请"
"确保它们直接对齐在栓孔上方：如果孔被钢筋稍微覆盖，则配准可能会失败。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:110
msgid ""
"Do not draw too close to the pegbar holes. Avoid drawing anything with the "
"same shape or area of the pegbar hole in the pegbar holes area; leave at "
"least 1 cm (~1/2”) of clear space between the pegbar holes and the rest of "
"your drawings. Lines drawn near the pegbar holes may cause the registration "
"to fail."
msgstr ""
"不要画得太靠近钉杆孔。避免在栓钉孔区域绘制与栓钉孔形状或面积相同的任何东西；在"
"钉杆孔和其余图形之间留出至少1厘米（约1/2英寸）的净空间。在钉杆孔附近绘制的线可"
"能会导致配准失败。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:116
msgid "Defining Animation Levels to Scan"
msgstr "定义要扫描的动画级别"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:117
msgid ""
"To scan an animation level, first you have to define its name, the number of "
"frames it is made of, and the way its drawings are numbered. Its size and "
"resolution will be set during the scanning session."
msgstr ""
"要扫描动画级别，首先必须定义其名称、帧数以及图形的编号方式。其大小和分辨率将在"
"扫描过程中设置。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:119
msgid ""
"The definition can be made drawing by drawing directly in the Xsheet/"
"Timeline, or at once by using the **New Level** dialog. You can assign it the "
"name and the numbering order you prefer."
msgstr ""
"要扫描动画级别，首先必须定义其名称、帧数以及图形的编号方式。其大小和分辨率将在"
"扫描过程中设置。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:121
msgid ""
"In case you use the **New Level** dialog you can set the number of drawings "
"the level is made of, the animation step to expose the level repeating its "
"frames, and the increment, that sets the way the level drawings are numbered. "
"For example a **Step:** value 2 repeats each drawing twice in the Xsheet "
"column (or Timeline layer), while an **Increment:** value 2 numbers the "
"drawings 1, 3, 5, etc."
msgstr ""
"如果使用**新建标高**对话框，则可以设置标高所包含的图形数量、重复帧显示标高的动"
"画步骤以及设置标高图形编号方式的增量。例如，**步：**值2在Xsheet列（或时间线"
"层）中重复每个图形两次，而**增量：**值2中的图形编号为1、3、5等。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:123
msgid "|new_scan_level|"
msgstr "|新扫描级别|"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:125
msgid ""
"By default scanned drawings are saved in the **+inputs** directory of the "
"current project; if the *+inputs* definition uses the $scenepath variable, "
"they are saved only if the scene is saved (see  :ref:`Project Default Folders "
"<project_default_folders>`  )."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，扫描的图纸保存在当前项目的**+inputs**目录中；如果*+inputs*定义使用"
"$scenepath变量，则只有在保存场景时才会保存它们（请参阅：ref:“项目默认文件夹"
"<Project_Default_Folders>”）。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:127
msgid ""
"You can change the location by using either the **Path:** field in the **New "
"Level** dialog, or the **Level Settings** window in case you define a level "
"directly in Xsheet/Timeline."
msgstr ""
"您可以使用**新建级别**对话框中的**路径：**字段或**级别设置**窗口（如果您直接在"
"Xsheet/Timeline中定义级别）更改位置。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:129
msgid ""
"Settings such as the length of the level and the numbering order can be "
"edited later, as you are free to arrange the images composing your animation "
"level the way you prefer (see  :ref:`Editing Animation Levels "
"<editing_animation_levels>`  )."
msgstr ""
"稍后可以编辑级别长度和编号顺序等设置，因为您可以自由地以自己喜欢的方式排列组成"
"动画级别的图像（请参阅：ref:`编辑动画级别<Editing_animation_Levels>）。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:131
msgid ""
"When an animation level is defined, the name and numbers for the drawings of "
"the level are displayed in *red* as no level actually exists yet; the column/"
"layer cells where the level is exposed are colored in *light blue*, the color "
"denoting full-color images (see  :ref:`Working with Columns/Layers "
"<working_with_xsheet_columns>`  )."
msgstr ""
"当定义动画级别时，该级别图形的名称和编号显示为*红色*，因为实际上还不存在级别；"
"暴露级别的列/层单元格以*浅蓝色*着色，该颜色表示全彩图像（请参阅：ref:“使用列/"
"层<Working_with_xsheet_Columns>”）。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:133
msgid "**To define an animation level directly in Xsheet:**"
msgstr "**要在Xsheet中直接定义动画级别，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:135
msgid ""
"Double-click a cell, then type a name and a number; the name and the number "
"must be separated by a space."
msgstr "双击单元格，然后键入名称和数字；姓名和号码必须用空格隔开。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:137
msgid ""
"Press **Enter** to add a new drawing, and type a different number that will "
"be assigned to the new drawing."
msgstr "按**Enter**添加新图形，然后键入将分配给新图形的其他编号。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:139
msgid "Go on adding all the drawings you need."
msgstr "继续添加你需要的所有图纸。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:141
msgid "Click a different cell to end the process."
msgstr "单击其他单元格以结束该过程。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:143
msgid "**To define an animation level with the New Level dialog:**"
msgstr "**要使用“新建级别”对话框定义动画级别，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:147
msgid ""
"Select a cell in the Xsheet/Timeline where you want to place your animation "
"level to scan and choose Level  →  New  →  **New Level...**"
msgstr ""
"在Xsheet/Timeline中选择要放置动画级别进行扫描的单元格，然后选择级别→  New  →  "
"**新水平。..**"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:149
msgid ""
"Right-click the cell in the Xsheet/Timeline where you want to place your "
"animation level to scan and choose **New Level** from the menu that opens."
msgstr ""
"右键单击Xsheet/Timeline中要放置动画级别进行扫描的单元格，然后从打开的菜单中选"
"择**新建级别**。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:151
msgid ""
"If any level is already exposed in the cell column/layer, it will shift down/"
"right from the cell you selected on."
msgstr ""
"如果单元格列/层中已经暴露了任何级别，它将从您选择的单元格向下/向右移动。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:153
msgid ""
"In the New Level dialog choose **Scan Level** from the **Type:** option menu "
"and define its settings, then click the **OK** button."
msgstr ""
"在“新建级别”对话框中，从**类型：**选项菜单中选择**扫描级别**并定义其设置，然后"
"单击**确定**按钮。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:155
msgid "**To define the saving location for the level to be scanned:**"
msgstr "**要定义要扫描的级别的保存位置，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:159
msgid ""
"If you are using the **New Level** dialog, type in the **Path:** field, or "
"use the browser button, to set the path for the saving location."
msgstr ""
"如果使用**新建级别**对话框，请在**路径：**字段中键入，或使用浏览器按钮设置保存"
"位置的路径。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:161
msgid ""
"If you are defining the level directly in Xsheet/Timeline, right-click the "
"level cells and select **Level Settings** from the menu that opens. In the "
"Level Settings window, type in the **Path:** field, or use the browser "
"button, to set the path for the saving location."
msgstr ""
"如果您直接在Xsheet/Timeline中定义级别，请右键单击级别单元格，然后从打开的菜单"
"中选择**级别设置**。在“级别设置”窗口中，键入**路径：**字段，或使用浏览器按钮设"
"置保存位置的路径。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:163
msgid ""
"If in the browser you choose any project default folder, in the **Path:** "
"field the full path will be replace by the related default folder alias "
"(see  :ref:`Project Default Folders <project_default_folders>`  )."
msgstr ""
"如果在浏览器中选择任何项目默认文件夹，则在**路径：**字段中，完整路径将被相关的"
"默认文件夹别名替换（请参阅：ref:“项目默认文件夹<project_default_Folders>”）。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:169
msgid "Scanning Drawings"
msgstr "扫描图纸"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:170
msgid ""
"According to the driver you are using, internal or TWAIN, the scanning "
"process will be controlled either by the Scan Settings dialog or the TWAIN "
"interface."
msgstr ""
"根据您使用的驱动程序（内部驱动程序或TWAIN驱动程序），扫描过程将由“扫描设置”对"
"话框或者TWAIN界面控制。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:172
msgid "|scan_settings|"
msgstr "|扫描设置|"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:174
msgid "The Scan Settings dialog allows you to define the following:"
msgstr "扫描设置对话框允许您定义以下内容："

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:176
msgid ""
"**Paper Format** sets the size for the drawings to be scanned. The option "
"menu contains a list of already defined formats."
msgstr "**纸张格式**设置要扫描的图纸的大小。选项菜单包含已定义格式的列表。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:178
msgid ""
"**Reverse Order** makes the scanning process in a reverse order, starting "
"from the last selected frame to the first one."
msgstr ""
"**反转顺序**使扫描过程以相反的顺序进行，从最后一个选定的帧开始到第一个帧。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:180
msgid ""
"**Paper Feeder** lets the scanner use the automatic document feeder, in case "
"the scanner has one, to scan all the selected drawings without having to "
"insert one image at a time into the scanner."
msgstr ""
"**进纸器**允许扫描仪使用自动文档进纸器（如果扫描仪有）扫描所有选定的图形，而无"
"需一次将一个图像插入扫描仪。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:182
msgid ""
"**Mode** is for setting the scanning mode among: **Black and White**, "
"**Greyscale** and **Color**."
msgstr "**模式**用于在**黑白**、**灰度**和**彩色**之间设置扫描模式。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:184
msgid ""
"The TWAIN interface is related to the scanner you are using and will be "
"available only when the TWAIN drivers, provided with the scanner, are "
"installed on your computer. Refer to the scanner documentation for more "
"details."
msgstr ""
"TWAIN接口与您正在使用的扫描仪有关，只有在您的计算机上安装了扫描仪附带的TWAIN驱"
"动程序时才能使用。有关更多详细信息，请参阅扫描仪文档。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:186
msgid ""
"The Scan Settings dialog can be used in combination with the TWAIN interface "
"settings to set the Reverse Order option."
msgstr "扫描设置对话框可以与TWAIN界面设置结合使用，以设置反向顺序选项。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:188
msgid ""
"The settings, either defined in the Scan Settings dialog or in the TWAIN "
"interface, will be used to scan the drawings selected in the Xsheet/Timeline. "
"In case you select several drawings, and you are using the scanner paper "
"feeder, all the drawings to be scanned will be taken from the feeder; if you "
"are not using the paper feeder, you will be prompted to replace the drawing "
"on the scanner bed, before scanning the following drawing."
msgstr ""
"在“扫描设置”对话框或TWAIN界面中定义的设置将用于扫描在Xsheet/Timeline中选择的图"
"形。如果您选择了多个图纸，并且您正在使用扫描仪进纸器，则所有要扫描的图纸都将从"
"进纸器中取出；如果您没有使用进纸器，在扫描以下图形之前，系统将提示您更换扫描仪"
"床上的图形。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:190
msgid ""
"You can also select non-consecutive drawings and drawings from different "
"animation levels. Levels will be scanned starting from the first selected "
"column/layer. Only exposed drawings will be scanned according the level "
"numbering order, regardless of the way the animation level is exposed in one "
"or several Xsheet columns (or Timeline layers). The opposite order will be "
"followed if the **Reverse Order** option is on."
msgstr ""
"您还可以选择非连续图形和来自不同动画级别的图形。将从第一个选定的列/层开始扫描"
"级别。无论动画级别在一个或多个Xsheet列（或时间线层）中以何种方式显示，都只会根"
"据级别编号顺序扫描显示的图形。如果启用了**反转**选项，则将遵循相反的顺序。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:192
msgid ""
"As soon as a drawing is scanned, it is saved and its name and number "
"displayed in the Xsheet/Timeline turn black, as the level now has physical "
"drawings saved on disk."
msgstr ""
"一旦扫描了图形，它就会被保存，其名称和编号显示在Xsheet/Timeline中会变为黑色，"
"因为该级别现在将物理图形保存在磁盘上。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:194
msgid ""
"Images are saved as compressed TIF files with a progressive four-digits "
"number written between the file name and the file extension, e.g. "
"``animation.0001.tif`` , ``animation.0002.tif`` , etc. They are displayed in "
"the OpenToonz browser with a double dot before the file extension, e.g. "
"``animation..tif`` ."
msgstr ""
"图像保存为压缩的TIF文件，文件名和文件扩展名之间写有递增的四位数，例"
"如“animation.0001.TIF”、“animation-0002.TIF”等。它们在OpenToonz浏览器中显示，"
"文件扩展名前有一个双点，例如“animation”。.tif。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:196
msgid ""
"If you need to scan again an animation level, or a part of it, select the "
"relevant drawings and scan them again. Drawings can be also inserted by "
"editing the level sequence (see  :ref:`Renumbering and Adding Frames in a "
"Level <renumbering_and_adding_frames_in_a_level>`  )."
msgstr ""
"如果需要再次扫描动画级别或其一部分，请选择相关图形并再次扫描。也可以通过编辑级"
"别顺序插入图形（请参见：ref:“在级别中重新编号和添加帧<重新编号_和添加帧_输入_"
"级别>”）。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:198
msgid "**To scan an animation level:**"
msgstr "**要扫描动画级别，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:200
msgid "In the Xsheet/Timeline, select the drawings you want to scan."
msgstr "在Xsheet/Timeline中，选择要扫描的图形。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:202
msgid ""
"Choose Scan & Cleanup  →  **Scan Settings...** and use the dialog to control "
"scan options."
msgstr "选择扫描和清理→  **扫描设置。..**并使用对话框控制扫描选项。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:206
msgid ""
"If you are using the internal drivers, choose Scan & Cleanup  →  **Scan**: "
"the selected drawings will be scanned and automatically saved."
msgstr ""
"如果您使用的是内部驱动程序，请选择扫描和清理→  **扫描**：所选图纸将被扫描并自"
"动保存。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:208
msgid ""
"If you are using the TWAIN drivers, choose Scan & Cleanup  →  **Scan**, and "
"guide the scanning process by using the TWAIN interface that opens: the "
"selected drawings will be scanned and automatically saved."
msgstr ""
"如果您使用的是TWAIN驱动程序，请选择扫描和清理→  **扫描**，并使用打开的TWAIN界"
"面指导扫描过程：所选图形将被扫描并自动保存。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:210
msgid "In case you selected several drawings, do one of the following:"
msgstr "如果选择了多个图形，请执行以下操作之一："

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:212
msgid ""
"If you are using the scanner paper feeder, wait for all of the drawings to be "
"scanned."
msgstr "如果您使用的是扫描仪进纸器，请等待所有图纸都被扫描。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:214
msgid ""
"If you are not using the paper feeder, you will be prompted to replace the "
"drawing on the scanner bed, before scanning the following drawing."
msgstr ""
"如果您没有使用进纸器，在扫描以下图形之前，系统将提示您更换扫描仪床上的图形。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:216
msgid ""
"After a drawing is scanned, or several drawings are scanned at once by using "
"the paper feeder, in some TWAIN interfaces you may need to use a specific "
"command (such as **Back to Application**) to return to OpenToonz before "
"proceeding with the next scanning session. Refer to the scanner documentation "
"for more details."
msgstr ""
"在扫描完一个图形或使用进纸器一次扫描多个图形后，在某些TWAIN界面中，您可能需要"
"使用特定命令（如**返回应用程序**）返回OpenToonz，然后才能继续下一个扫描会话。"
"有关更多详细信息，请参阅扫描仪文档。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:222
msgid "Setting the Cropbox"
msgstr "设置Cropbox"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:223
msgid ""
"When using directly supported scanners it is possible to define a *cropbox* "
"smaller than the paper format to optimize the scanning process. When the "
"*cropbox* is set the final scanned image will be the size of the selected "
"paper format, but only the area defined by the *cropbox* is actually scanned, "
"thus speeding up the scanning operations."
msgstr ""
"使用直接支持的扫描仪时，可以定义一个比纸张格式小的*cropbox*，以优化扫描过程。"
"当设置了*cropbox*时，最终扫描的图像将是所选纸张格式的大小，但实际上只有"
"*cropbox*定义的区域被扫描，从而加快了扫描操作。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:225
msgid ""
"Once defined the cropbox will be used for any scanning performed for the "
"scene."
msgstr "一旦定义，cropbox将用于对场景执行的任何扫描。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:227
msgid ""
"The cropbox size information is not saved along with the scene file; it is "
"also automatically reset when working on a new scene."
msgstr "cropbox大小信息不与场景文件一起保存；在处理新场景时，它也会自动重置。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:229
msgid "**To define the scanning cropbox:**"
msgstr "**要定义扫描框，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:231
msgid ""
"Choose Scan & Cleanup  →  **Set Cropbox**: the drawing currently placed in "
"the scanner is scanned and the cropbox is displayed in *red*."
msgstr ""
"选择扫描和清理→  **设置Cropbox**：扫描当前放置在扫描仪中的图形，并将Cropbox显"
"示为*红色*。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:233
msgid ""
"Use the handles along the cropbox to set its size, and click and drag "
"anywhere to change its position."
msgstr "使用滚动框上的控制柄设置其大小，然后单击并拖动任意位置以更改其位置。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:235
msgid "The cropbox default size is the same as the size of the scanned image."
msgstr "cropbox默认大小与扫描图像的大小相同。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:237
msgid "The cropbox cannot be moved outside the area of the scanned image."
msgstr "滚动框不能移动到扫描图像的区域之外。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:239
msgid "**To use the defined cropbox when scanning:**"
msgstr "**要在扫描时使用定义的cropbox：**"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:241
msgid "Scan drawings after defining the cropbox size (see above )."
msgstr "在定义了cropbox大小后扫描图纸（见上文）。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:243
msgid "**To dismiss the scanning cropbox visualization:**"
msgstr "**要关闭扫描cropbox可视化：**"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:245
msgid "Choose Scan & Cleanup  →  **Set Cropbox**."
msgstr "选择扫描和清理→  **设置Cropbox**。"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:247
msgid "**To reset the scanning cropbox:**"
msgstr "**要重置扫描框，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/scanning_paper_drawings.rst:249
msgid "Choose Scan & Cleanup  →  **Reset Cropbox**."
msgstr "选择扫描和清理→ **重置Cropbox**。"
